WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Interfaces and subsystems. Notice what changes and what stays the same.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:31.000
LEARNING TARGET: Map exchanges between parts

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:38.000
THE BIG IDEA: Interfaces are places where systems exchange force, energy, heat, space or information. They need explicit assumptions.

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:45.000
WORKED EXAMPLE: Connect a wheel-speed sensor to a controller: the interface carries a signal, not mechanical torque.

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:52.000
PAUSE AND PREDICT: System map

00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:59.000
MODEL LIMIT: A system diagram is a model, not a finished vehicle or proof of roadworthiness.

00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:06.000
TAKEAWAY: Map exchanges between parts
